    "name_raw": "Expanded Enhance Arrows",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Player Companion: Chronicle of Legends",
    "definition_raw": "Your magical arrows produce a wider range of powers.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Enhance arrows class feature.\n\nBenefit(s): You add corrosive to the list of special properties you can grant your non-magical arrows with your enhance arrows ability at 3rd level.\n\nAt 5th level, you can add the ghost touch, limning, or planar special ability instead of distance.\n\nAt 7th level, you can add the corrosive burst special ability.",
